extends RefCounted

# Pass 54, voxB: voice transformations. Each one runs natively (purrcore dsp/pack_voxb.h) on a
# pitch synchronous voice engine: a pitch tracker, pitch marks and PSOLA grains with their own
# formant scale, so pitch and the size of the throat move separately and the voice stays a voice.

